flowchart LR
  P[Typed producer] -->|server tenant + IDs/versions| V[Port authorization and strict catalog]
  V -->|semantic key + named queue| G[Graphile public adapter]
  G --> C{Protected worker class}
  C --> H[Versioned handler]
  H --> A[Canonical tenant reauthorization]
  A --> E[Effect guard and payload-free ledger]
  E --> L{Canonical lookupEffect}
  L -->|already completed| S[Suppress duplicate and acknowledge delivery]
  L -->|absent| X[Perform with deterministic effectKey]
  X --> R[Record canonical effect result]
  R --> D[Acknowledge delivery only]
  X -->|ambiguous/retryable| G
